{"id":"e6935daced0fa530","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3Decision.md","title":"L3Decision","display":"L3Decision","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"L3Decision","parameters":["g","a","b"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"L3Decision"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>a</span><span>b</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：三值语义与有限表证书。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>b</code>。</p>\n<p>仅合法有限输入上的总判定；无限前提仍只由 L3Conseq 定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ L3Decision g a b)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ L3FiniteInput g a)\n  (or (and (@ Num1 b) (exists p (@ L3Proof g p a))) (and (@ Num0 b) (not (exists p (@ L3Proof g p a))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e56e1132597c40e3\" href=\"?note=e56e1132597c40e3\" title=\"ZFC_L3FiniteInput\">L3FiniteInput</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"399e79d7cc96c3d4\" href=\"?note=399e79d7cc96c3d4\" title=\"ZFC_L3Proof\">L3Proof</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6abf464803506304\" href=\"?note=6abf464803506304\" title=\"ZFC_Num1\">Num1</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ L3Decision g a b)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_L3FiniteInput","status":"resolved","id":"e56e1132597c40e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_L3FiniteInput|L3FiniteInput]]；[[ZFC_L3Proof|L3Proof]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_L3Proof","status":"resolved","id":"399e79d7cc96c3d4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_L3FiniteInput|L3FiniteInput]]；[[ZFC_L3Proof|L3Proof]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Num0","status":"resolved","id":"e8cec2782b4668b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_L3FiniteInput|L3FiniteInput]]；[[ZFC_L3Proof|L3Proof]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Num1","status":"resolved","id":"6abf464803506304","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_L3FiniteInput|L3FiniteInput]]；[[ZFC_L3Proof|L3Proof]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":961,"backlinks":[{"id":"bd45a4b3eda7a6d6","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3Decision|L3Decision]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-736","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_L3Decision|L3Decision]